    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d411">

                <pb facs="0842" n="810" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v13p1/pg810"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Secretary’s Letters, lot 56 D 459.
                    “President”</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the President</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1953-09-29">September 29, 1953</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum For The
                    President</hi></p>
                <p>All of the understandings we sought with the French regarding Indochina have now
                    been concluded and it is expected that the Exchange of Notes, or
                        Agreements,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d411-f1"/> will be signed at 6 p.m. Paris
                    time today. An agreed communiqué will be issued at 6 p.m. Paris time tomorrow
                    (noon, Washington time).</p>
                <p>I attach a copy of the communiqué.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">John Foster
                    Dulles</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d411-a1.xml" xpointer="d411-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
